---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Page
	title="Work with OPUS"
	eyebrow="Work"
	lede="We design mobile products for a small number of startups, the same way we make our own: from the person outwards, native to the platform, calm, and honest about money."
	path="/work/"
	current="work"
>
	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			It is not the right fit for every product. It is right for founders who want the people using their product
			to feel looked after, and who are willing to let that shape the business rather than the other way round.
		</p>
		<p>
			We have designed and built camera apps, wallets and tools people use every day, for companies in the United
			States and Scandinavia, over nearly two decades.
		</p>
		<p>
			Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> with what you are making and where it is. We
			reply to everything.
		</p>
	</div>
</Page>
